      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T21:52:25Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know the details of the implementation in LEAudioService but whatever we do, we must not trigger calls to AudioManager.handleBluetoothActiveDeviceChange() as a result of receiving either of those audio manager callabcks.",
      "parentUuid": "6c6cf998_68164c0c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2229,
